# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/drafter-arms four-card window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of the integrated branch and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch that holds them.
# TWO IMAGES: tp4-drafter-1 (the default drafter manifest, dedf8df6: the control arm and the bf16 arm) and tp4-drafter-b16-1 (the block-16 candidate manifest, b16-98759a49). Both are built by the
# integration step from the same commit, the candidate with C2_DRAFTER_MANIFEST (B1); the candidate's fixtures are staged on the build host first (drafter_stage.py stage).
# A tag that already exists is skipped by the build step: the tags must be fresh. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# QUALIFICATION OF A GO ARM ONLY (ORDER.txt: NEEDS ... <- the arm's D-T job passed the pair report's GO rule). Written for the b16 candidate on image tp4-drafter-b16-1; for a GO bf16 arm the same jobs run on tp4-drafter-1
# with the dbf16 profiles of the tp4-dbf16-jobs pack. A drafter swap changes round boundaries and trace sequences, so every exactness and hang gate is re-run (the verified text must not change).
# 
# D-Q3: the singles and quad audits on the four-live paths (the pair and the quad drafts) with the audited profile: concurrent4_code_equal and the split (concurrent5_split moves a seat between
# blocks). READ: every [DRAFT-SINGLES-AUDIT] line bit-equal, texts equal across the seat counts. Duration (estimate): 70 min. Kill rule: any mismatch stops the qualification.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-drafter-b16-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-audit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4_code_equal,concurrent4_code_32k,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
# Knowingly omits concurrent8_steady: without this key c2_serving_job.py refuses the job. The smoke check is unchanged, so the run still ends red on its eight-seat rule; read the logs.
C2_SMOKE_PARTIAL=audited quad-draft arm: its test list is fixed by the pack protocol, so concurrent8_steady is not run
